cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "pth-flash-attn: a FlashAttention-style CUDA kernel for vLLM's int8 per-token-head paged KV cache"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "noon-at-cgn"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/noon-at-cgn/pth-flash-attn"
abstract: >-
  A forward-only attention kernel for NVIDIA Ampere and Ada GPUs (sm80, sm86,
  sm89) that reads vLLM's int8_per_token_head paged KV cache in place, with
  int8 keys and values and inline fp32 scales consumed by tensor cores, plus a
  PyTorch op, a launch planner and a vLLM attention-backend plugin.
keywords:
  - attention
  - flash-attention
  - cuda
  - kv-cache
  - int8
  - quantization
  - vllm
  - pytorch
  - llm-inference
  - gpu-kernels
